abstract: >-
  A vision-only classical controller for the Anduril AI Grand Prix Virtual
  Qualifier (simulated drone racing, no position telemetry), with unattended
  campaign automation and a 546-attempt overnight dataset whose forensic
  replay located systematic, non-random failure mechanisms at the third gate.
